| Pattern          | Purpose                      | Android Example     |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |
| Singleton        | Single instance              | Retrofit, Room      |
| Factory          | Create objects               | ViewModelFactory    |
| Abstract Factory | Create related families      | Theme systems       |
| Builder          | Step-by-step object creation | AlertDialog.Builder |
| Prototype        | Clone existing object        | data class copy()   |
